FailAt 21
MakeDir RAM:T RAM:ENV RAM:ENVARC RAM:Clipboards
Assign T: RAM:T
Assign ENV: RAM:ENV
Assign ENVARC: RAM:ENVARC
Assign CLIPS: RAM:Clipboards
Assign LIBS: SYS:Classes ADD
Assign KEYMAPS: DEVS:Keymaps
Assign LOCALE: SYS:Locale
Assign FONTS: SYS:Fonts
Assign WANDERER: SYS:System/Wanderer
Stack 1048576
C:IPrefs
If EXISTS C:OpenZFSPipeTest
    Mount DEVS:DOSDrivers/PIPE
    C:OpenZFSPipeTest
    If WARN
        Echo "OpenZFS pipe dependency test FAILED"
        Quit 20
    EndIf
EndIf
Echo "OpenZFS no-service Manager: shell launch"
SYS:Tools/OpenZFSManagerNative
Echo "OpenZFS no-service Manager: shell returned"
Run >T:wanderer.log SYS:System/Wanderer/Wanderer
Echo "OpenZFS no-service Manager: desktop launch pending"
Wait 2 SECS
; A real tool icon is required: WBRun without one uses the CLI path.
; This is a private test fixture, not the distributable Manager icon.
Copy SYS:Tools/OpenZFSManagerNative RAM:OpenZFSManagerNative
Copy SYS:Tools/Calculator.info RAM:OpenZFSManagerNative.info
C:WBRun RAM:OpenZFSManagerNative
EndCLI
